    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408720/extras/03bfb7e25b2c87c102203da8c7be56bd.avif?t=1738013961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two xenobiologists find themselves stranded on a mysterious planet that appears intent on their anihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the eerie landscapes shrouded in darkness, solve intricate challenges, and battle against the relentless forces of this hostile world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decision you make could mean the difference between survival and becoming a victim of the planet\u2019s deadly secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth behind Simon's disappearance and escape the clutches of this hostile environment, or will you succumb to the horrors of <i>Kosmosis</i>? Your fate lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark monochromatic pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horrid mosters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down explorer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
